OL,3,GNEWSAFresh target for 94-year-old in
OL,4,Ahospice challenge
OL,5,
OL,6,FA 94-year-old man who challenged
OL,7,Fhimself to walk 100 miles before his
OL,8,F95th birthday has set himself a new
OL,9,Ftarget after reaching his goal with two
OL,10,Fmonths to spare.
OL,12,FSmudge Smith from Telford started on 3
OL,13,FJuly with the aim of supporting Severn
OL,14,FHospice and has so far raised more than
OL,15,F#3,000 for the charity.
OL,17,FHe chose the hospice because of the
OL,18,Fsupport it gave his late wife,
OL,19,FMargaret, and said: "I will remain
OL,20,Feternally grateful for everything the
OL,21,Fteam did for her."
OL,23,APub: 29-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
